This kid is good

11
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:29,040
Then tonight I will be a hands-off shopkeeper.

12
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:33,060
No problem grandma

13
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:35,260
Is your waist uncomfortable? Is it okay?

14
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,060
